{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight for humanity\u2019s survival in <strong>IRON GUARD: Salvation - a thrilling Tower Defense with strategy elements.</strong> Build defenses, upgrade turrets, and repel relentless robot waves with your handheld drone. Only your tactical brilliance can save humanity across battles on various planets including the hostile world of <strong>Acris</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/90ed6a8bfa359c5bae96496ed5f1cad1.poster.avif?t=1760983497\" width=1170 height=657 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/90ed6a8bfa359c5bae96496ed5f1cad1.webm?t=1760983497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEROES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/64a886c5f66fc2827753b101fc033b61.webp?t=1760983497\" width=1560 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command heroes</strong> \u2013 control Graves, Irina, and Mitchell, each with unique abilities that can shift the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/4ccf0525445349dd21835cd55b448aaa.poster.avif?t=1760983497\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/4ccf0525445349dd21835cd55b448aaa.webm?t=1760983497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/64a886c5f66fc2827753b101fc033b61.webp?t=1760983497\" width=1560 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/00eed2c247032aa48bcb169c0105b444.webp?t=1760983497\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Fast-paced gameplay</strong> \u2013 enemies adapt to each battle. Choose your difficulty and how to play: oversee from above or manually fire from your drone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/207613e0a9002d11cbed77cf82089e68.webp?t=1760983497\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Multiple modes and mechanics.</strong> Play in different styles, adapt each run, and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/c821ee22862375ab1276bd02cf550255.webp?t=1760983497\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Formidable foes</strong> \u2013 distinct enemy tactics test your skills. Carefully choose and combine turrets, and make full use of battlefield opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/5f511ab80393dba1b299d68400be485b.webp?t=1760983497\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Upgrades and resource management</strong> \u2013 level up turrets and drone; use harvesters, minerals, and factories for a steady resource flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/95482ada6791c95489d5e8ba8f140b3a.webp?t=1760983497\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Tactical control</strong> \u2013 command from above, or shrink into the action and immerse yourself in a giant\u2019s world of turrets and machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARSENAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/64a886c5f66fc2827753b101fc033b61.webp?t=1760983497\" width=1560 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>25+ turrets</strong>, move platforms to adapt defenses, deploy <strong>superweapons</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/0ff6182473b06e63172db1e8a30227ce.avif?t=1760983497\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/64a886c5f66fc2827753b101fc033b61.webp?t=1760983497\" width=1560 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 hand-crafted levels</strong> across many planets \u2013 each with new obstacles and strategic opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams